{
  "_doc": [
    "Reaction tuning (documentation/journals/reaction_damage_rework_journal.md).",
    "Which pair produces which reaction is code (combat/elements/config.py",
    "REACTION_PAIRS); this file only tunes each one. A reaction may carry a",
    "\"triggered_by\" block with partial overrides per incoming element, e.g.",
    "\"triggered_by\": {\"fire\": {\"damage\": {\"high\": 0.9, \"low\": 0.2}}} --",
    "only the pair's own elements and only keys the reaction already has.",
    "With no overrides both directions are identical. Every reaction locks",
    "the aura slot for the global cooldown; lock_aura_slot / lock_duration",
    "extend it.",
    "",
    "A \"damage\" value is a PAIR (owner's rework, 2026-09-22): a reaction is",
    "produced by TWO hits -- the one that placed the aura and the one that",
    "triggered it -- and pays \"high\" of the larger and \"low\" of the smaller.",
    "Setting the two equal pays the same share of both, which is what the",
    "three Wind reactions do (30 % of each). The figure lands on the enemy",
    "the reaction fired on AND on every enemy it reaches; only the carrier's",
    "is raised to global.reaction_min_damage."
  ],
